{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">印尼一艘渡輪由峇里島出發後起火，最少一人死亡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">渡輪起火後冒出大量濃煙，當地搜救部門表示，渡輪載客名單顯示，船上載有114名乘客及17名船員，但實際人數更多，渡輪由峇里島前往龍目島，當地時間凌晨約四時，在龍目海峽起火。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.FERRY-1400_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Bjsv1Lrqws1786518205.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.INDO.FERRY-1400_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">搜救人員及途經的其他船隻，救起逾170人，搜索工作仍在繼續，但現場有四米高的海浪，影響搜救行動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.FERRY-1400_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026KcG0uQujX11786518192.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.INDO.FERRY-1400_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T07:20:53.134775+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}